Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\mathcal M,\\Gamma,L\\in V\">\\(M,\\mathcal M,\\Gamma,L\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9TransitiveModelCandidate}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9TransitiveModelCandidate}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}model\\text{-}candidate} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9TransitiveModelCandidate}_S(M,\\Gamma,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(\\Gamma,L)\\land\n\\exists\\mathcal M\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal M=\\langle M,\\in\\cap M^2\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\\land\